# wezterm's palette (dots/.config/wezterm/wezterm.lua), so the two terminals
# KOOMPI ships look alike. tests/test_terminal_scheme.sh holds them together.
# Opacity is Konsole's own: at wezterm's 0.8 it shows far more wallpaper.

